This directory is DELIBERATELY EMPTY of *.meta.json files.

It is the test data for "this session has exactly ZERO subagents", which
validation-criteria.md AC4 requires to be reported DISTINCTLY from "unknown"
(NFR5: no opinion is not the same as no). The session whose subagents/
directory is ABSENT entirely is
projects/-Users-user-dev-agent-fleet-sessions/3b90f6cc-1d47-4e20-8a3b-9f5e6c0d2a18
-- it has no such directory, and that is the "unknown" case.

This placeholder exists only because git does not track empty directories.
It doubles as a negative control for the `*.meta.json` suffix filter: a
counter that counts directory entries rather than matching the suffix will
report 1 here instead of 0, and TestSubagentCountZeroIsNotUnknown will fail.
